        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Gannett\n- Products: Nevada newspapers\n- People: Henry Rust Mighels\n- Organizations: Nevada School of Law\n- Places: Nevada\n\nFacts:\n- In Nevada, a Gannett company-owned daily newspaper ranked ahead of another newspaper that placed third among the state's largest newspapers.\n- The Nevada School of Law was moved to the plant of that other newspaper.\n- Henry Rust Mighels, a Croatian journalist, was the editor of that other newspaper.",
